ce has been spat at and your life has been destroyed by <strong>your own body</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have to lock in and <strong>prove once and for all that mind rules over matter and not the other way around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/59332abab84186160be75d1ef3be5174.avif?t=1771257642\" width=1560 height=583 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This colorful gem of a gaming experience with unbelievably punchy soundtrack and infuriatingly pushy enemies is everything you need! <i>(if everything you need is a game about a head that is screaming)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/793c588e3711d57e5ddb656d9c9fe7b3.apng?t=1771257642\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/793c588e3711d57e5ddb656d9c9fe7b3.poster.avif?t=1771257642\" class=\"bb_img\" width=84 height=84 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/3bda4bef4518b987fd02ca49462b487f.apng?t=1771257642\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372460/extras/3bda4bef4518b987fd02ca49462b487f.poster.avif?t=1771257642\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=160 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We've got:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 warp zones to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32 levels to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully vo